Sat Oct 31 09:37:31 UTC 2026 - Tomáš Chvátal <tomas.chvatal@gmail.com>

- Set Version to 20261030.
- Fix libglfw-devel to glfw-devel (renamed provider) and promote it with glm-
  devel, libXi-devel and libXxf86vm-devel from Suggests to Recommends.
- Pattern Suggests were the DVD pull mechanism of 2008, but that mechanism is
  dead: pattern Suggests land on no current install media, every product, so
  dropping them changes the installed set not at all today.
- Add libvulkan_lvp Recommends (software ICD) and promote the libvulkan_intel and
  libvulkan_radeon ICDs from Suggests to Recommends; drop the gcc-c++ Suggests
  (already covered by the C and C++ patterns).
- Recommend the C++ development pattern.
- Add Recommends renderdoc (the standard Vulkan frame debugger) in a new
  Debugging tools SECTION.
- Raise the no-binary rpmlintrc filter from warning to error level.
- Format with spec-cleaner 1.3.1: drop the Group
  tags, fix the copyright header, and label the Recommends with SECTION headers.

